For each number n:

  1. Calculate the remainder: rem = n % 37
  2. Map rem according to the rule:
      • 0 - 25 → Uppercase letters 'A' - 'Z' (0 = A, 1 = B, ..., 25 = Z)
      • 26 - 35 → Digits '0' - '9' (26 = 0, 27 = 1, ..., 35 = 9)
      • 36 → Underscore _

