  ### 3. Python Solve One-Liner

  You can run this directly in your terminal inside ~/Music/PICO-CTF/picoctfAI/crypto:

    python3 -c "
    import string
    charset = string.ascii_uppercase + string.digits + '_'
    with open('basic-mod.txt') as f:
        nums = map(int, f.read().split())
    msg = ''.join(charset[n % 37] for n in nums)
    print(f'picoCTF{{{msg}}}')
    "
